% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been sung or played by students. A Grade 6 music teacher must trial the 5/4 song with its 3+2 ostinato, the triplets and the word stresses; a jazz educator should check the listening framing and the credit to Paul Desmond; a second score reader must check the notes and the word setting.
